Package: noshape
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: noshape <noshape@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, libxcb1, libx11-xcb1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libfreetype6, libfontconfig1, libwayland-client0, libvulkan1
Recommends: mesa-vulkan-drivers
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/yekta/noshape
Description: fast, fully local, parametric CAD
 noshape works like Onshape: Part Studios, sketches, assemblies, drawings,
 FeatureScript, versions and import/export, offline. The noshape command is
 also the command line tool and the MCP server for coding agents
 (`noshape mcp`); `noshape agents connect` registers it with Claude Code,
 the Codex CLI and Claude Desktop.
